{"id":"vod_bf_45338","vodId":"45338","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"政宗君的复仇","name_cn":"政宗君的复仇","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-46/d2c5ef6cb6b9661b344a7b492476e098.jpg"},"summary":"真壁政宗（花江夏树 配音）小时候是个小胖子，被同班同学取了“猪脚”的绰号，整日生活在自卑和嘲笑之中，之后，政宗转校，同时接受了为期八年的训练，终于恢复了正常人的身材，亦意外的发现自己其实拥有一副帅气的面孔。如今，政宗回到了曾经生活过的城市，满腔怒火的他制定了一系列报复计 划，发誓要让当年给他取绰号的女孩安达垣爱姬（大桥彩香 配音）体会一下他曾经体会过的屈辱。　　和政宗有着相似经历的千金大小姐藤之宫宁子（三森铃子 配音）、沉默寡言内向腹黑的小岩井吉乃（水濑祈  配音）、沉迷于耽美文化的腐女子双叶妙（田所梓 配音），在这些可爱女孩子们的围绕下，政宗的复仇计划能够顺利实施吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:14:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhengzongjundefuchou/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:16.370Z"}